{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:f6ed2aeeaa4b0e5f","name":"Attack Run","source":{"id":"source:reference-f6ed2aeeaa4b0e5f","title":"Attack Run","revision":16005,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:31Z","sha256":"e17e8fef32fe9b0b97ae876f4267931f749b096acdcd602f7b682372e9c9b0e0","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16005","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Attack%20Run&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-f6ed2aeeaa4b0e5f","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," can move up to their Vehicle's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," (minimum 2 squares) in a straight line through unobstructed terrain directly toward their target, and then make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Attack"}," at that target at the end of their movement. You gain a +2 bonus on your attack roll, and take a -2 penalty to your Vehicle's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," until the start of your next turn.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Scale"},", you cannot make an Attack Run through squares occupied by opponents, but allies do not hinder your Attack Run.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
